  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi Donor Trust Fund for TradeRelated Assistance in Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this multi-donor trust fund for trade-related  assistance, the Trade Development Trust Fund (TDTF) is to maximize the  contribution of trade to economic development and poverty reduction in  Cambodia. The purpose of the activities to be funded by the TDTF are  to increase efficiency in policy implementation, transparency in  trade-related transactions, export competitiveness, and enhance  institutional and human capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
